  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Against Fang Yuan it is faster than Horizontal Charge Gu and Vertical Crash Gu, but the black stone forest terrain can still keep Ju Kai Bei from catching him.",
        "chapters": [
          319
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_horizontal_charge_gu",
          "gu_vertical_crash_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Together with dragon guts Gu and dragon-elephant Gu, it forms a resonance of Dao marks from similar law fragments, which greatly raises the chance that Ju Kai Bei’s dragon-elephant phantom appears.",
        "chapters": [
          319
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_guts_gu",
          "gu_dragon_elephant_huge_strength_gu",
          "sys_dao_marks"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ju Kai Bei activates it to dodge Fang Yuan’s first vertical crash, then later to press the attack after reclaiming footing with two dragon-elephant phantoms.",
        "chapters": [
          318
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-against-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "While Fang Yuan heals with self-reliance Gu among the black stone pillars, the Gu is still faster than Fang Yuan’s charge pair, yet the terrain keeps Ju Kai Bei from landing a clean catch.",
        "chapters": [
          319
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-against-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_self_reliance_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He also uses it to open space before his djinn transformation killer move, and again to charge once that move has enlarged his body three times; with longer strides, the Gu makes him even faster.",
        "chapters": [
          319
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-against-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Near the end of the match he thinks of using it to retreat, but eight solidified beast phantoms already pin him in place.",
        "chapters": [
          320
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-against-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
